    "Pro 1: 'Streamlined communication and task management' was replaced by 'Efficient task creation and management' because multiple notes highlighted the speed and ease of creating and managing tasks (e.g., inline forms, rapid entry, autocomplete, drag-and-drop reordering).",
    "Con 3: 'Difficulty with organizing sub-tasks or detailed reporting' was replaced by 'Basic reporting and calendar views for project progress' because notes specifically pointed out the lack of a project calendar tool for progress tracking and the limited utility of the 'My Events' view, which is a more specific and impactful limitation than just 'difficulty with organizing sub-tasks' (which was partially addressed by inline subtasks)."
